      "description": "We are seeking two exceptional individuals at Assistant Professor level with substantial expertise in medical education and who are expected to take on a combination of the roles described below. The allocation will occur after the appointment and will be dependant on the candidates’ expertise and experience.\n\nPosting closes: 2026-10-21",
      "department": null
